    <p>
      I am a sophomore at the University of Utah's David Eccles School of Business, majoring in
      Finance with a FinTech emphasis and minoring in Business AI. This past summer, I interned at
      Celtic Bank as a FinTech &amp; AI Automation Analyst, working across embedded finance product
      design and automation. I'm especially drawn to the payments and SaaS side of fintech, and I'm
      fascinated by how quickly AI is reshaping financial services. Outside of class, I run an
      independent AI consulting practice, building agentic workflows using platforms like MindStudio.
